Reason: macOS attach mode for the UI thread (plan.md §2.4 step 3). An
embedder that already runs -[NSApplication run] (gpui) attaches the browser's
UI-thread task runner to that run loop instead of calling Run(), as iOS's
MessagePumpUIApplication::Attach does. Widens the iOS-only Attach/Detach
plumbing to macOS; Chromium's own apps never attach, and Detach is a no-op
unless attached, so their behaviour is unchanged. Unlike iOS, the attached
loop has no RunLoop object (run_loop.h's friend list would need a patch that
recompiles most of the tree). No upstream bug.

